# Route reachability of every certified grammar, read from route counters.
# Cells: engine:detail. core:fresh|incr|forest, a '<reason' suffix names the reparse fallback;
# legacy:<decline reasons>, '-' when no decline counter moved (the core was not asked).
# Grammars without a registered token source use an end-of-input stub: the route is chosen before a token is read.
# entry_point	core	compact	legacy	skip	error
# parser_parse	71	0	0	0	0
# parser_parse_strict	71	0	0	0	0
# parser_parse_utf16	71	0	0	0	0
# parser_parse_token_source	3	0	68	0	0
# parser_parse_token_source_factory	3	0	68	0	0
# parser_parse_forest_experimental	1	0	70	0	0
# parser_incremental_clean_edit	60	0	0	11	0
# parser_incremental_with_old_tree_option	60	0	0	11	0
# parser_incremental_token_source	2	0	58	11	0
# parser_incremental_edit_to_error	56	0	0	15	0
# parser_incremental_edit_from_error	56	0	0	15	0
# parser_included_ranges_parse	0	0	71	0	0
# parser_included_ranges_incremental	0	0	71	0	0
# lang_entry_parse	71	0	0	0	0
# lang_entry_parse_context	71	0	0	0	0
# highlighter_highlight	71	0	0	0	0
# highlighter_incremental	60	0	0	11	0
